Frames: with frames=true, the server sends each frame of the app's display as the
virtio-gpu resource Android drew it into (FrameStreamer, and Vendor/frames for the native
part that finds the resource), and the Mac copies it on the GPU instead of decoding video.
These changes come after the ones above.

